ttf-caladea (Googles Caladea font)

Caladea is a free modern, friendly serif font family
based on Cambo Designed by Carolina Giovagnoli
and Andrés Torresi for Huerta Tipográfica in 2012.

Main differences in Caladea:
1. More condensed width
2. New metrics
3. 4 styles (regular, bold, italic, and bold italic styles)
4. Character set expanded to WGL (418 glyphs)

This packages both the truetype and the opentype font.
